Enhancements by XiaoHaiSly
--------------------------

This enhanced version includes modifications and additional functionality
developed and maintained by XiaoHaiSly, including:

- Core Only mode for independent sing-box core operation
- Custom sing-box configuration support
- Enhanced core configuration management
- Core configuration loading and processing improvements
- Core configuration injection and management
- Enhanced core cache handling
- Built-in Core Config Editor
- Manual configuration and core file management
- Custom profile and subscription file management
- Automatic detection and management of available configuration files
- Support for editing custom core configuration files
- Improved handling of large configuration files
- Additional OpenWrt integration and usability improvements

